IBM Enterprise COBOL Compile Listing
PROGRAM-ID: BIZDATE
SOURCE-SHA256: 68cf5f5e6694779ae55200d2eea8cf99a381099090dcb794f14f7d6d0d55b291
COMPILE-STATUS: SUCCESS
CALL-XREF: NONE
COPY-XREF: DATEPARM, HOLIDAY
EXPANDED-SOURCE-BEGIN
       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. BIZDATE.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       COPY DATEPARM.
       COPY HOLIDAY.
       LINKAGE SECTION.
       01 LK-RC PIC S9(4) COMP.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING LK-RC.
       CHECK-BUSINESS-DATE.
           ACCEPT RUN-DATE FROM DATE YYYYMMDD
           MOVE 0 TO LK-RC
           IF RUN-MM < 1 OR RUN-MM > 12 MOVE 8 TO LK-RC END-IF
           IF RUN-DD < 1 OR RUN-DD > 31 MOVE 8 TO LK-RC END-IF
           GOBACK.
EXPANDED-SOURCE-END
